<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tower Semiconductor rating raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tower Semiconductor rating raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co research analyst Dan Klesken raised his rating on Tower Semiconductor Ltd from a market performer to long-term attractive.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We believe the worst is over for Tower and now see revenues and earnings beginning to grow,&quot; said Klesken.</p>
<p>-- He raised his fiscal 1996 EPS estimate for Tower to $0.72 from $0.66. His estimate for fiscal l997 earnings is $0.35.</p>
</text>
